@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Awareness Modules";
}
<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-4">
    <div>
        <h2 class="gradient-title mb-1">Awareness Modules</h2>
        <p class="small-muted mb-0">Learn to identify the key indicators of modern cyber attacks and social engineering.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="badge badge-nextjs">6 Learning Modules</span>
</div>

<div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">📧</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Fake Emails</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Phishing emails masquerading as reputable organizations.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> "Suspicious login detected — verify identity within 24h."</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> Sense of urgency, generic greeting, suspicious sender domain.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Check sender header, do not click links, report &amp; mark spam.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">📱</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">SMS / Smishing</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Malicious text messages containing deceptive URLs.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> "Your package is held. Pay $1 fee to release."</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> Shortened links (bit.ly/tinyurl), unknown sender digits.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Never click embedded links. Contact carrier or courier directly.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">🔳</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">QR Code Phishing (Quishing)</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Malicious QR codes overlaying physical or digital posters.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> "Scan QR code to win cashback or pay parking fee."</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> Tampered stickers, web pages prompting for login right after scan.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Inspect destination URL preview carefully before opening.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">🎭</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Social Engineering</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Psychological manipulation to trick victims into divulging data.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> Caller posing as bank executive requesting OTP to unfreeze account.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> High pressure tactics, fear of penalty, secrecy.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Hang up immediately and call official support number.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">🏦</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Fake Banking Alerts</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Fraudulent notifications impersonating financial institutions.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> "Your debit card is blocked. Click here to reactivate."</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> Non-HTTPS links, requesting card number/PIN/CVV.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Login strictly via official mobile banking application.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                    <span class="fs-4">🛠️</span>
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">Tech Support Scams</h5>
                </div>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>What:</strong> Scammers pretending to be tech support to install remote RAT software.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Example:</strong> "Your PC has 5 viruses. Install AnyDesk for remote fix."</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-2"><strong>Red flags:</strong> Unsolicited popups with loud audio alarms or cold calls.</p>
                <p class="small-muted mb-0"><strong>Action:</strong> Never grant remote access to unverified callers.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
